                "Use deterministic code for amount arithmetic, currency conversion, fee calculations, refund calculations, net settlement, transaction matching, duplicate detection, timestamp ordering, status transitions, invoice matching, batch reconciliation, identifier normalization, and graph traversal.",
                "Use AI for merchant resolution proposals, purpose interpretation, hypothesis generation, contradiction analysis, and narrative synthesis.",
                "Never rely on language-model arithmetic for payment totals, settlement totals, refund totals, fee totals, chargeback totals, net loss, or FX calculations.",
            ],
        }

